^{T}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{+} & =V\\,{Σ}^{+}\\,{U}^{T} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{50}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{50}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{50}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186420790 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186162091 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff858037-da99-53e9-acdc-e4963e7d765e" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Pseudoinverse of a Matrix Given Its Reduced Singular Value Decomposition"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1243f8e9-7cde-50e1-b4da-69c3c09e0244" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{50}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420760} {:answer/id #uuid "396c503f-4112-5172-aabe-628ff629a730" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420766} {:answer/id #uuid "71ce3c99-faa6-5850-9bb1-6d482034baca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420771} {:answer/id 